e need to interpret the bounded objective string: \"Apply the registered sparse IDF scaling, row normalization, self-similarity removal, and degree construction without dense materialization.\" It also says \"Validate every required field before computing a result.\" And \"Treat these registered properties as hard contracts rather than soft preferences: sparse_only, self_similarity_removed, finite_degree, numeric_tolerance.\" So we need to implement exactly that pipeline: IDF scaling (sparse only: only apply to nonzero entries, which we can do), row normalization (L2 normalization of each row after IDF weighting), self-similarity removal (exclude diagonal when computing degree), degree construction (compute row sums of normalized pairwise similarities without forming the full matrix). So the output: weighted matrix ("},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":843,"completion_tokens":1024,"total_tokens":1867,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":768},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1024},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":768,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":75},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}